  "reasoning": "The defendant, He 2, repeatedly made false statements claiming that the township party secretary Yang assaulted him, despite evidence showing his injuries were self-inflicted and unrelated to any assault. He disseminated these false allegations through television interviews, online posts, and petitions, causing serious damage to Yang's reputation. This conduct meets the elements of criminal defamation (捏造事实诽谤他人，情节严重) under Article 246 of the Criminal Law. No evidence supports a charge of assault or other crimes. Therefore, the appropriate charge is defamation.",
